    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"rest and let go of the pressure\"... that sounds so nice. But it almost feels like there's no way to actually do that while I'm still here, you know? Like, if the goal was the only thing keeping me moving, and I've reached it and it's empty... what's the point of the next step? There's no next step.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
