      "content": "\"let the fog swallow you\"... that's a heavy thing to say. It sounds like you're saying the struggle is just unnecessary now. Like, if the climb is over and there's nothing there, then staying in the fight just seems like a waste of energy. Is it really just... okay to stop? To just give up on everything?",
